# scripts/verify-operator-docs.sh treats every 10-digit number in docs/operators/
# and docs/assets/terminal/*.session as an unredacted caller number — PII that
# escaped redaction — unless it is listed here or is a 555 documentation number.
# That default-deny is the point: adding a number here should be a deliberate,
# reviewable act, not something a capture can do silently.
